flowchart TB
    A[用户问题进入 chat] --> B[ChatService chat]
    B --> C[解析 mounted knowledge sources]
    C --> D[组装候选 retrieval tools]
    D --> E[AgenticRetriever retrieve_with_trace]

    subgraph RAG1[Agentic Retrieval 阶段：收集证据并做决策]
        E --> F[第 N 轮选择当前 RetrievalTool]
        F --> G{当前 tool}
        G -->|knowledge_document_search| H[DocumentRetrievalService retrieve]
        H --> H1[语义召回]
        H --> H2[关键词召回]
        H1 --> H3[HybridFusionRanker]
        H2 --> H3
        H3 --> H4[相关度过滤与受管文档过滤]
        H4 --> I[生成 RetrievalResult 含 documents 与 citations]

        G -->|product review order semantic search| J[KnowledgeService vector search]
        J --> I

        G -->|inventory lookup or product detail lookup| K[结构化精确查询]
        K --> I

        I --> L[SufficiencyJudge]
        L --> M{决策}
        M -->|finish| N[聚合证据完成]
        M -->|switch_tool| F
        M -->|rewrite| O[QueryRewriter]
        O --> F
        M -->|ask_user| P[停止检索并追问用户]
    end

    N --> Q[ChatService invoke chain with docs]
    P --> Q2[返回兜底或追问式回答]

    subgraph RAG2[Answer Generation 阶段：基于证据生成回答]
        Q --> R[将 documents 组织成带编号上下文]
        R --> S[LLM answer chain]
        S --> T[输出带引用标记的回答]
    end

    T --> U[落库存储 answer 与 retrieval snippets]
    Q2 --> U
    U --> V[返回 answer 与 citations]
